uilds/kamisatoayato/261111-225016/zh-3.t.webp","w":1080,"h":1350,"kind":"why","links":[{"n":"Haran Geppaku Futsu","r":[0.1093,0.2548,0.0454,0.0363],"k":"w"},{"n":"Primordial Jade Cutter","r":[0.1093,0.3141,0.0454,0.0363],"k":"w"},{"n":"Mistsplitter Reforged","r":[0.1093,0.3593,0.0454,0.0363],"k":"w"},{"n":"Heart of Depth","r":[0.5231,0.2548,0.0454,0.0363],"k":"a"},{"n":"Gladiator's Finale","r":[0.5231,0.3281,0.0454,0.0363],"k":"a"},{"n":"Echoes of an Offering","r":[0.5231,0.3944,0.0454,0.0363],"k":"a"},{"n":"Kamisato Ayato","r":[0.0815,0.503,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Nahida","r":[0.125,0.503,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Kuki Shinobu","r":[0.1685,0.503,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Fischl","r":[0.212,0.503,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Kamisato Ayato","r":[0.0815,0.5622,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Nilou","r":[0.125,0.5622,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Nahida","r":[0.1685,0.5622,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Baizhu","r":[0.212,0.5622,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Kamisato Ayato","r":[0.0815,0.6215,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Thoma","r":[0.125,0.6215,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Nahida","r":[0.1685,0.6215,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Fischl","r":[0.212,0.6215,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Kamisato Ayato","r":[0.0815,0.6807,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Fischl","r":[0.125,0.6807,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Beidou","r":[0.1685,0.6807,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Sucrose","r":[0.212,0.6807,0.0361,0.0289]}]}]}},"thumb":"content/genshin/builds/kamisatoayato/261111-225016/en-1.t.webp","why":{"w":[{"name":"Haran Geppaku Futsu","text":"Signature CRIT Rate sword. Its Elemental DMG and Normal Attack bonuses strongly enhance Skill-empowered Shunsuiken. Use teammate Skills before Ayato Skill."},{"name":"Primordial Jade Cutter","text":"Excellent CR and HP-to-ATK conversion."},{"name":"Mistsplitter Reforged","text":"High CD and Elemental DMG bonuses."},{"name":"Uraku Misugiri","text":"High CD and Normal Attack bonuses."},{"name":"The Black Sword","text":"Reliable CRIT Rate and Normal Attack DMG, plus a small heal during Shunsuiken attacks. One of his best 4-star swords."},{"name":"Calamity of Eshu","text":"Boosts Normal Attack DMG and CRIT Rate while shielded; can outperform Black Sword in shield teams. Only while protected by a shield."},{"name":"Kagotsurube Isshin","text":"Free Story Quest sword with ATK and a useful hit-triggered ATK buff. An accessible option for on-field Ayato."},{"name":"Lion's Roar","text":"Increases damage against Electro-affected foes, making it viable in Electro-Charged teams only. Electro aura must remain on targets. Higher refinement improves this niche."}],"a":[{"names":["Heart of Depth"],"text":"A top general-purpose set: Hydro DMG plus a Normal Attack damage buff after Skill use.","stats":"ATK% · Hydro DMG · CRIT"},{"names":["Gladiator's Finale"],"text":"Another top set; its ATK% and Normal Attack bonus perform close to Heart of Depth. Choose better substats.","stats":"ATK% · Hydro DMG · CRIT"},{"names":["Echoes of an Offering"],"text":"Competitive Normal Attack proc set.","stats":"ATK% · Hydro DMG · CRIT"}],"t":[{"name":"Boba Hyperbloom","members":["Kamisato Ayato","Nahida","Kuki Shinobu","Fischl"],"text":"Ayato creates Dendro Cores with Nahida; full-EM Kuki triggers Hyperbloom and heals. Fischl adds damage and Electro energy.","roles":["On-field DPS","Dendro Enabler / Buffer","Healer / Reaction Trigger","Off-field DPS / Battery"]},{"name":"Blooming Boba","members":["Kamisato Ayato","Nilou","Nahida","Baizhu"],"text":"Nilou enables Bountiful Cores, Nahida provides Dendro, Baizhu heals, and Ayato applies AoE Hydro. Manage Bloom self-damage.","roles":["On-field DPS","Bloom Buffer / Hydro Enabler","Dendro Enabler / Buffer","Healer / Shielder"]},{"name":"Burgeon Boba","members":["Kamisato Ayato","Thoma","Nahida","Fischl"],"text":"Ayato makes cores with Nahida; EM Thoma detonates them. Fischl adds damage and reduces Burning. Shielding may need extra sustain.","roles":["On-field DPS","Burgeon Trigger / Shielder","Dendro Enabler / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Battery"]},{"name":"Sparkle Princess","members":["Kamisato Ayato","Fischl","Beidou","Sucrose"],"text":"Ayato drives Fischl and Beidou while applying Hydro; Sucrose groups foes and shreds resistances. Beidou appreciates Electro energy.","roles":["On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Battery","Off-field DPS","EM Buffer / Debuffer"]}],"v":"Furina Carry: With Furina and reliable healing, use Marechaussee Hunter; avoid overcapping CRIT Rate.\nBurst Support: Use Emblem and an ER sword for off-field Hydro coverage; one Skill per Burst and higher ER.\nHyperbloom Driver: Keep a standard CRIT build; Electro trigger builds full EM and activates the Dendro Cores.\nShielded DPS: Calamity of Eshu is excellent with a reliable shield from Thoma, Kirara, Citlali, or Dahlia.\nElectro-Charged: In Double Electro teams, 4pc Thundering Fury can shorten Skill cooldown for quicker rotations.","n":3},"seo":{"roles":["Main DPS"],"about":"Ayato is an on-field Hydro DPS whose Elemental Skill unleashes rapid AoE Shunsuiken slashes. His Burst adds off-field Hydro application and Normal Attack damage buffs. He fits Hyperbloom, Burgeon, Electro-Charged and carry teams, with flexible rotations and gear.","pros":["Consistent AoE Hydro","Flexible reaction teams","Strong at C0","Easy Skill combo"],"cons":["Lengthy Skill cooldown","Burst needs Energy","Limited burst damage","F2P swords are weaker"],"weapons":["Haran Geppaku Futsu","Primordial Jade Cutter","Mistsplitter Reforged","Uraku Misugiri","The Black Sword","Calamity of Eshu","Kagotsurube Isshin","Lion's Roar"],"arts":[{"sets":["Heart of Depth"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Best"},{"sets":["Gladiator's Finale"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Echoes of an Offering"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""}],"main":["ATK%","Hydro DMG","Crit Rate / Crit DMG"],"stats":["CRIT Rate: 65% - 80%","CRIT DMG: 130% - 190%","ATK: 1,700 - 2,200","ER Solo Hydro: 130% - 160%","ER Double Hydro: 120% - 135%"],"vars":[{"title":"Furina Hypercarry","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["Haran Geppaku Futsu","Primordial Jade Cutter","The Black Sword"],"arts":[{"sets":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Heart of Depth"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"CRIT Rate can be lower with 4pc Marechaussee; keep ATK%/Hydro/CRIT and enough ER.","teams":"Furina plus a reliable team healer such as Xilonen or Jean.","when":"Use this when Furina enables frequent HP changes to activate Marechaussee Hunter.","cond":"Requires consistent Furina HP fluctuation.","notes":"Be mindful that Ayato Burst can snapshot before Marechaussee CRIT stacks build.","pre":false},{"title":"Off-Field Burst Support","role":"Off-field DPS","weapons":["Favonius Sword","Skyward Blade","Mistsplitter Reforged"],"arts":[{"sets":["Emblem of Severed Fate"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Use ER Sands as needed; solo-Hydro, one-Skill rotations may need 155–175% ER or more.","teams":"An on-field carry that values extra Hydro application; account for cooldown and Energy.","when":"Use Ayato for his Burst droplets and Normal Attack buff when a different unit needs field time.","cond":"One Skill per Burst; more demanding Energy requirements.","notes":"Favonius sacrifices personal damage for team particles. Noblesse only if no teammate already carries it.","pre":false},{"title":"Shielded Normal Attack DPS","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["Calamity of Eshu","Haran Geppaku Futsu","The Black Sword"],"arts":[{"sets":["Heart of Depth"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Gladiator's Finale"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Standard ATK%/Hydro/CRIT; balance CRIT with Eshu shielded bonuses.","teams":"Reliable shield such as Thoma, Kirara, Citlali, or Dahlia.","when":"Use an accessible event sword that shines while the shield stays active.","cond":"Shield uptime required for its damage and CRIT passive.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Electro-Charged Cooldown","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["Lion's Roar","The Black Sword","Haran Geppaku Futsu"],"arts":[{"sets":["Thundering Fury"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Heart of Depth"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Normal offen